=-3$; from $A+B+49=9$ get $B=-37$. Substitution checks the forcing and the two initial conditions." 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754406 1058 #edb/ref 17592186754356 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754406 1062 #uuid "ebacf0c7-872c-53f7-a6fe-49c32fa5128b" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754406 1063 #edb/ref 17592186754329 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754407 1058 #edb/ref 17592186754311 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754407 1062 #uuid "ebbae188-ee53-5fa5-a031-5f6d82c5ccc4" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754407 1063 #edb/ref 17592186754301 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754408 1058 #edb/ref 17592186754278 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754408 1062 #uuid "ee0fe595-d332-5a2a-916a-871d7f180a7a" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754408 1063 #edb/ref 17592186754360 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754409 1068 #edb/ref 17592186754271 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754409 1071 "Find $W(t)=W(y_1,y_2)$.\n\n$W(t)=$ {{solution}}." 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754409 1072 #uuid "ee194d6c-d21a-5cb4-a14d-555dcea2e811" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754409 1074 "Directly, $y_1'=3(e^{3t}-e^{-t/3})/10$ and $y_2'=(9e^{3t}+e^{-t/3})/10$. Thus $W=y_1y_2'-y_1'y_2=e^{3t}e^{-t/3}=e^{8t/3}$. For an independent check, normalize the ODE to $y''-(8/3)y'-y=0$. Abel's identity gives $W=Ce^{8t/3}$, and the initial data give $W(0)=1$, hence $C=1$. The Wronskian is nonzero for all real $t$." 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754410 1075 #edb/ref 17592186754332 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754410 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754410 1077 "solution" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754410 1078 #edb/ref 17592186754332 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754410 1079 #uuid "f1f2e346-177c-56e2-a7b6-7ca3cd89256f" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754411 1058 #edb/ref 17592186754365 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754411 1062 #uuid "f308afd9-3092-5fa4-bf2f-28baf98c0489" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754411 1063 #edb/ref 17592186754394 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754412 1080 "- 2 x + \\left(c_1 \\cos{\\left(x \\right)} + c_2 \\sin{\\left(x \\right)}\\right) e^{- 2 x} + \\frac{8}{5} + \\frac{3 e^{- x}}{2}" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754412 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754412 1083 #uuid "f448108f-b153-5893-8bcf-0f60f4d0dbc9" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754413 1075 #edb/ref 17592186754339 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754413 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754413 1077 "solution" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754413 1078 #edb/ref 17592186754339 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754413 1079 #uuid "f845bbe2-7db1-521a-adf9-435ad7b760a7" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754414 1058 #edb/ref 17592186754280 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754414 1062 #uuid "f9364f8a-4ee6-5b53-9ea4-24b702ecb503" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754414 1063 #edb/ref 17592186754307 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754415 1075 #edb/ref 17592186754376 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754415 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754415 1077 "solution" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754415 1078 #edb/ref 17592186754376 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754415 1079 #uuid "fb068b1f-c522-5d19-bc64-756037577628" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754416 1080 "\\left(c_1 + c_2 x\\right) e^{4 x}" 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754416 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139546555 17592186502323 true] [17592186754416 1083 #uuid "fe6db1aa-8a90-5db3-8452-01c3d48ee93e" 13194139546555 17592186